| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 0 | 0.366 | 0.954 | 0.41 | 0.839 | (no true mu) |
| 0.25 | 0.311 | 0.905 | 0.47 | 0.865 | 0.763 |
| 0.5 | 0.142 | 0.740 | 0.65 | 0.941 | 0.878 |
